# Wrecker Elaine at the jetty's head on Wreckers' Cove (CIPlay wreckers_cove_talk, 11-12 w15 prep; in a test world
# 'CI ...'). She stands at -6.5 -3.5 on the hamlet's terrace (2.4 m). Her three answers: the false lantern (journal), the
# way under Jory's Crown (shows the land way's sign wcvinesign, hidden till then), sail on. No quest step.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Wreckers' Cove keep
hour 11
weather Calm

expect hidden wcvinesign
picture wc_islander -7.5 +2.4 -8 -6.5 +0.9 -3.5
use Wrecker Elaine pick 1
expect message Two lights on the point
read The false lantern
use Wrecker Elaine pick 2
expect message Mind the stakes
expect shown wcvinesign
use Wrecker Elaine pick 3
expect message sail wide of the point
